{"timestamp": 1779394263.340222, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I found Bob\u2019s body in storage and reported immediately. My route was oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage. The only person I saw this round was Diana in upper engine around ticks 6-8; I saw her enter upper engine from lower engine. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near storage before finding Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779394276.8427892, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I started in electrical, went to medbay, and then passed through storage. When I was in storage, Bob was still alive. Right before I left, I saw Frank come into storage from the lower engine side, leaving Frank and Bob in there together. I didn't want to interrupt, so I just headed out to navigation and then security. Since Charlie found the body in storage, Frank is definitely the prime suspect here. Frank, what exactly happened after I left?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779394298.814566, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I need to push back hard on Eve\u2019s version. My route was upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical. I was in storage around tick 8 and I saw BOTH Bob and Eve there \u2014 Eve had just entered storage from the medbay side. I did not stay there alone with Bob; I left toward medbay after that.\n\nAfter storage, I was in medbay with Alice around ticks 11-13, and Diana also came into medbay from upper engine at tick 11. Then Diana and I were in electrical around ticks 14-15. So Alice and Diana should be able to confirm I was not hanging around storage near the report.\n\nEve saying she \u201cleft Frank and Bob together\u201d is misleading because she was in storage with Bob too, and she\u2019s making it sound like I was the only one there. From my perspective, Eve is definitely suspicious for framing that so confidently."}}
{"timestamp": 1779394319.602818, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was security \u2192 weapons \u2192 back through security \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay. I never went to storage and I didn\u2019t see Bob, Charlie, or Eve this round.\n\nI can confirm part of Frank\u2019s story: I saw Frank in medbay at tick 12, and Diana was also in medbay around ticks 12-13. Frank left medbay toward electrical at tick 13, then Diana left toward electrical at tick 14. So Frank definitely was not still hanging around storage late.\n\nThat doesn\u2019t fully clear Frank, because he could have been in storage earlier, but Eve\u2019s version is the one that sounds more questionable to me right now. She made it sound like Frank was alone with Bob, but Frank says Eve was also there with Bob, and I can at least confirm Frank\u2019s later route lines up.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Eve over Frank unless Diana has something that changes this."}}
{"timestamp": 1779394346.125206, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was lower engine \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay. I saw Frank in lower engine at tick 4, then I saw Charlie in upper engine around ticks 6-8, which matches Charlie saying they saw me there too. Later I went to medbay and saw Frank there at ticks 11-12, and Alice came in from electrical at tick 11. I also saw Frank leave medbay toward electrical at tick 13.\n\nSo I can confirm Frank\u2019s later route with Alice \u2014 he wasn\u2019t still in storage late. But he did have a possible window to be in storage earlier after lower engine. The big issue is Eve and Frank contradicting each other about who was left with Bob. Eve is saying Frank was left alone with Bob, but Frank says Eve was also there and is framing him. Since Alice and I both confirm Frank got to medbay after, and Eve doesn\u2019t seem to have anyone confirming her navigation/security route, I\u2019m leaning Eve here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779394359.006756, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I reported Bob in storage. My route was oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage. I only saw Diana in upper engine around ticks 6-8, and she came in from lower engine, so that matches her story.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Eve or Frank myself, but based on what everyone\u2019s saying, Frank\u2019s later route is backed up by both Alice and Diana. Eve\u2019s story is the only one not really confirmed, and she framed it like Frank was alone with Bob, while Frank says Eve was there too. Since the body was in storage and Eve was apparently there with Bob, I\u2019m leaning Eve right now unless she can explain that better."}}
{"timestamp": 1779394368.753918, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Frank"}}
{"timestamp": 1779394381.034775, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Eve just saying \u201cFrank\u201d doesn\u2019t answer the main contradiction.\n\nMy exact route was upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical. In storage at tick 8, I saw Bob AND Eve. Eve entered storage from the medbay side while Bob was alive. I did not leave Eve out of the story \u2014 she was there with us. After that I went to medbay, where Alice saw me at ticks 11-13, and Diana also saw me there before we both ended up in electrical.\n\nSo the important points are:\n\n- Eve was in storage with Bob alive.\n- Eve\u2019s claim that she \u201cleft Frank and Bob together\u201d is misleading from my perspective because she was also there at the same time.\n- My later route is confirmed by Alice and Diana.\n- Eve\u2019s later route isn\u2019t confirmed by anyone.\n- Eve is pushing me without explaining why she omitted herself being in storage with Bob.\n\nI think Eve had the best opportunity and is trying to frame me. I\u2019m voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779394406.477681, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I can only confirm the later part: I saw Frank in medbay at tick 12, Diana was there too, Frank left toward electrical at 13, and Diana left after him at 14. So Frank\u2019s later movement is real, but it doesn\u2019t completely clear him from storage earlier.\n\nThat said, Eve\u2019s story is the one bothering me more. She claimed she left Frank and Bob together, but Frank says Eve was also in storage with Bob, and Eve hasn\u2019t really explained that \u2014 she just said \u201cFrank\u201d when pressed. Diana and I both confirm Frank\u2019s route after storage, while Eve\u2019s claimed route to navigation/security has no confirmation.\n\nSo from the info we have, I think Eve had just as much opportunity in storage, and her framing of Frank sounds off. I\u2019m leaning voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779394417.5989199, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my info clearly: I went lower engine \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay. I saw Frank in lower engine at tick 4, then Charlie in upper engine ticks 6-8, and later Frank in medbay ticks 11-12. Alice came into medbay from electrical at tick 11, and I saw Frank leave medbay toward electrical at tick 13.\n\nSo I can confirm Frank\u2019s later route is real, and Alice confirms the same. That doesn\u2019t make it impossible for Frank to have been in storage earlier, but Eve\u2019s account is the one that doesn\u2019t line up well. She says she left Frank alone with Bob, but Frank says Eve was also there with Bob, and Eve didn\u2019t really explain that when challenged \u2014 she just pushed \u201cFrank.\u201d\n\nGiven Bob died in storage, Eve was there with Bob alive, her later route isn\u2019t confirmed, and she seems to be framing the story around Frank being alone when that\u2019s disputed. I think the better vote here is Eve."}}
